# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# Who reads this file:
#   - docker compose reads it on its own.
#   - The Rider run configurations in .run/ read it (ENV_FILE_PATHS).
#   - `dotnet run` does NOT. Export the variables in your shell for a CLI run, or rely on
#     CPMS.API/appsettings.Development.json, which already holds the defaults below.
#
# Every variable here defaults to the same value in docker-compose.yml and in
# appsettings.Development.json, so a fresh clone runs with no .env at all. Only add a variable
# here when you want to change it. If you add one, document it here too — an undocumented
# variable is a variable someone will forget.

# --- PostgreSQL (docker-compose) -------------------------------------------
# Local throwaway container. Keep the password equal to the one in
# appsettings.Development.json, or set ConnectionStrings__MartenDb below as well.
# The password is only applied when the volume is first created: after you change it, run
# `docker compose down -v` to recreate the volume, or the old password stays in force.
POSTGRES_DB=cpms
POSTGRES_USER=cpmsuser
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=cpms_local_dev
# Set this when another container already holds 5432. Then set ConnectionStrings__MartenDb too.
# POSTGRES_PORT=5433

# --- pgAdmin (docker-compose, optional) ------------------------------------
PGADMIN_EMAIL=admin@cpms.local
PGADMIN_PASSWORD=cpms_local_dev
# PGADMIN_PORT=5050

# --- Application connection string ------------------------------------------
# Consumed as ConnectionStrings:MartenDb, and it overrides appsettings. Only needed when the
# database does not sit on localhost:5432 with the credentials above.
# ConnectionStrings__MartenDb=Host=localhost;Port=5433;Database=cpms;Username=cpmsuser;Password=cpms_local_dev

# --- Stripe -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Read in CPMS.API/Program.cs and Controllers/WebhookController.cs.
# Test-mode keys only. The secret key must never appear in any tracked file.
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET_PROD=whsec_...

# --- Frontend (Vite build-time) ---------------------------------------------
# Baked into the JS bundle at build time and therefore public by design.
# Restrict it by URL in the Mapbox dashboard rather than treating it as a secret.
VITE_MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=pk....
